  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dibed ni wachako pwoyorenu kendo? Koso wachako dwaro barupe mag pwoch moa kuomu, kata mwabirogo iru, kaka jomoko ohero timo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Un e barupewa, mondiki e chunywa, kendo ma ji duto ongʼeyo, kendo somo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unyiso ni un barupe moa kuom Kristo, ma tijwa okelo, ma ok ondiki gi wino, to mondiki gi Roho Maler mar Nyasaye mangima, bende ok ma ondiki e kite mopa, to mondiki e chuny dhano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mano e chir ma wan-go kuom Nyasaye nikech Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ok ni wan gi nyalo moro kuomwa wawegi mar tiyo tijni, to nyalowa aa kuom Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osemiyowa nyalo mar bedo jotich mag singruok manyien, ma ok otenore kuom chik mondiki, to motenore kuom chuny, nikech chik kelo tho, to Roho to chiwo ngima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duongʼ ma singruok manyien kelo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro ka tich mane okelo tho, mane ondike kite mopa, ne obiro gi duongʼ mondo omi jo-Israel kik ngʼi wangʼ Musa tir nikech duongʼne kata obedo ni duongʼno ne dhi ka rumo kamano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To koro tich mar Roho dibed gi duongʼ machalo nadi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka tich ma ingʼadonego ji bura nigi duongʼ kamano, to tich, maketo ji kare, nyaka bed gi duongʼ moloyo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech gimane nigi duongʼ sani kindecha koro onge gi duongʼ minyalo pimo gi mano maduongʼ moloye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka mano marumo nobiro gi duongʼ kamano to kara koro mano masiko nyaka bed gi duongʼ mangʼongo moloyo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emomiyo ka koro wan gi geno machal kama, wawuoyo gi chir mathoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ok wachal gi Musa mane umo wangʼe mondo kik jo-Israel ne ka ler manie pat wangʼe rumo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To pachgi nosiko kodinore, nikech nyaka chil kawuono ragengʼno pod oumo chunygi ka isomo singruok machon. Pod ok ogole nikech ragengʼno igolo mana ka ngʼato ni kuom Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata mana sani kisomo chik Musa to ragengʼno pod oumo chunygi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To sa asaya ma ngʼato olokore odhi ir Ruoth to ragengʼno igolo oko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro Ruoth e Rohonogo; kendo kama Roho mar Ruoth nitie, thuolo nitie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro wan duto mwaonge gi ragengʼ e wengewa wachalo gi rangʼi kendo wamiyo ler mar ruoth nenore ratiro kendo lerno medore ameda pile ka kitwa medo bedo machal kode; mano en tich Ruoth ma en Roho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
